WEBVTT

00:00:02.140 --> 00:00:07.230
I wonder what it will be?  
This week, it’s this!

00:00:08.370 --> 00:00:09.990
It's a clown!

00:00:09.990 --> 00:00:14.990
It gains 1000 attack points for every 
card in the Spell and Trap Card Zone.

00:00:23.920 --> 00:00:28.380
It’s true, I tell ya!  Beyond the 
wall of flame, dozens of people were-

00:00:28.380 --> 00:00:34.550
They turned into a gigantic monster, 
right?  I heard that rumor too!

00:00:34.550 --> 00:00:42.550
It’s just an illusion.  Only homeless people 
are in that area, so it doesn’t matter to us.

00:00:42.550 --> 00:00:44.470
It should matter!

00:00:44.750 --> 00:00:46.950
Who are you?

00:00:46.950 --> 00:00:53.600
Me?  I’m just a passerby 
who’s on the side of justice.

00:00:54.830 --> 00:00:59.820
Don’t go into the central area!  Or else, 
you'll also be turned into a monster!

00:00:59.820 --> 00:01:03.540
You guys should hurry up and hide!

00:01:05.610 --> 00:01:08.980
Just wait, Dark Signer!

00:01:21.910 --> 00:01:26.650
Looking over a vast distance

00:01:26.910 --> 00:01:31.750
I realized my field of vision was narrow

00:01:32.020 --> 00:01:36.660
Even if it’s easier to throw myself away

00:01:37.020 --> 00:01:41.430
I want to survive to the best of my abilities

00:01:43.290 --> 00:01:46.790
No matter how bad today is

00:01:48.370 --> 00:01:51.780
There’s still the faintest light

00:01:53.540 --> 00:01:57.180
All I have to do tomorrow

00:01:57.470 --> 00:02:01.240
Is light it myself

00:02:01.550 --> 00:02:06.250
I test myself so I won’t stop or vanish

00:02:06.620 --> 00:02:11.220
Even if I get countless scars

00:02:11.720 --> 00:02:17.520
I ride wishing for the 
arrival of a true tomorrow

00:02:17.830 --> 00:02:21.500
Today will never exist again

00:02:21.830 --> 00:02:27.400
So I won’t stop or vanish

00:02:50.670 --> 00:02:56.240
Individual DecisionsWhat Can Be Truly Trusted

00:03:05.060 --> 00:03:10.390
Dark Signers are the souls of the 
dead that now have special abilities.

00:03:10.390 --> 00:03:14.920
In other words, they no longer exist.

00:03:16.390 --> 00:03:17.840
Kiryu…

00:03:23.730 --> 00:03:25.830
He’s in pain.

00:03:25.830 --> 00:03:29.420
You know Yusei feels, Aki?

00:03:29.420 --> 00:03:36.190
Yes.  Yusei feels that the bond 
between people is very important.

00:03:36.190 --> 00:03:42.230
That's why the fact that his friend turned 
into a Dark Signer hurts him deeply.

00:03:42.490 --> 00:03:45.130
I feel bad for Yusei.

00:03:45.130 --> 00:03:49.750
But what about you?  Are 
you prepared to fight?

00:03:49.750 --> 00:03:52.560
I’m ready.  Because…

00:03:54.880 --> 00:03:57.370
I have a reason to fight.

00:03:57.660 --> 00:04:00.490
Even a child is ready to fight...

00:04:02.060 --> 00:04:03.510
Yusei.

00:04:04.740 --> 00:04:07.960
I’m sorry.  I want to be left alone.

00:04:17.520 --> 00:04:19.250
Yusei…

00:04:27.270 --> 00:04:29.280
How are your plans progressing?

00:04:29.440 --> 00:04:32.020
Everything is on schedule.

00:04:46.850 --> 00:04:48.330
Jack…

00:04:49.310 --> 00:04:55.030
If Kiryu really died, then it’s my fault.

00:04:55.030 --> 00:04:58.340
He must have hated me a lot when he died.

00:04:58.840 --> 00:05:02.530
How can I fight him when 
I'm feeling like this?

00:05:03.260 --> 00:05:06.000
In order to defeat him permanently...

00:05:06.530 --> 00:05:08.500
What should I do?

00:05:08.500 --> 00:05:10.310
What should you do?

00:05:11.210 --> 00:05:12.510
I’ll show you!

00:05:15.240 --> 00:05:16.560
Jack…

00:05:39.350 --> 00:05:40.750
Aki?

00:05:40.750 --> 00:05:44.190
I’m sorry, but I already made my decision.

00:05:44.190 --> 00:05:48.250
I want to battle the Dark 
Signers as a Signer.

00:05:48.250 --> 00:05:49.360
Aki…

00:05:49.360 --> 00:05:52.350
Why do you have to do 
something that dangerous?

00:05:52.440 --> 00:05:55.560
Just when we finally became a family again!

00:05:55.970 --> 00:06:01.600
I’m very happy that Papa and Mama 
accepted me instead of running away.

00:06:01.600 --> 00:06:06.480
That’s why I also feel that I can’t 
run away from my responsibility.

00:06:06.480 --> 00:06:08.020
Responsibility?

00:06:08.020 --> 00:06:12.360
Arcadia Movement tried to 
lead the world into chaos.

00:06:12.650 --> 00:06:14.490
And I was one of its members.

00:06:14.490 --> 00:06:17.960
It’s not your fault.  They were using you.

00:06:18.120 --> 00:06:21.710
Even if that's true, I have to do something.

00:06:21.710 --> 00:06:28.290
Something bad is about to happen to Neo 
Domino City.  If my powers can help stop it...

00:06:28.290 --> 00:06:29.200
Still…

00:06:29.360 --> 00:06:37.860
Aki, if you can’t control your own 
power, then you might destroy yourself.

00:06:37.860 --> 00:06:39.440
Do you understand?

00:06:39.440 --> 00:06:40.660
Dear!

00:06:40.660 --> 00:06:43.210
I’m fine.  Don’t worry about me.

00:06:43.210 --> 00:06:47.800
You’re trying to find people 
you can trust from your heart.

00:06:48.870 --> 00:06:55.320
If Yusei’s by your side, then 
you probably won't lose yourself.

00:06:56.130 --> 00:06:57.310
Aki…

00:06:57.310 --> 00:07:05.490
Aki found what she truly wants to 
do.  Let’s trust our daughter.

00:07:07.220 --> 00:07:09.580
Thank you, Papa.

00:07:13.040 --> 00:07:15.530
Looks delicious!

00:07:16.570 --> 00:07:21.450
Which one should I choose?  
This, and this, and this!

00:07:21.450 --> 00:07:24.460
So this is where you were!

00:07:24.460 --> 00:07:27.180
Luca, you should also eat.  It’s delicious.

00:07:27.180 --> 00:07:30.420
How can you be so carefree?

00:07:30.420 --> 00:07:34.920
Because no one is coming to 
eat.  It would be a waste.

00:07:34.920 --> 00:07:37.150
No one has time for this.

00:07:37.150 --> 00:07:41.650
Lua, when you heard Director Godwin's 
story, didn’t it make you think?

00:07:41.650 --> 00:07:45.680
Not really.  Because I’m not a Signer.

00:07:45.680 --> 00:07:51.820
I’m stunned!  Everyone’s being serious!  
They can’t be carefree like you, Lua!

00:07:51.820 --> 00:07:56.420
Yeah, I’m carefree.  
Because I’m not a Signer.

00:07:56.420 --> 00:07:58.210
I can’t believe it!

00:07:58.210 --> 00:08:02.180
Luca, if you’re not going to eat, then 
I’m going to eat everything all by myself.

00:08:02.180 --> 00:08:07.670
Do whatever you want!  You can go to 
Satellite thinking that it’s a picnic!

00:08:08.660 --> 00:08:09.980
I’m not going.

00:08:11.270 --> 00:08:14.640
I’m not going to Satellite.

00:08:14.870 --> 00:08:17.850
What do you mean?

00:08:20.090 --> 00:08:21.350
Lua?

00:08:27.920 --> 00:08:35.440
I’ll defeat a couple Dark 
Signers before Yusei returns.

00:08:35.440 --> 00:08:39.190
That’s all I can do for now.

00:08:39.600 --> 00:08:41.710
There's the first one!

00:08:41.710 --> 00:08:45.200
He looks so shady that 
he must be a Dark Signer!

00:08:52.130 --> 00:08:54.230
I caught you!

00:08:55.180 --> 00:08:55.930
Huh?

00:08:58.700 --> 00:09:01.790
Where did he go?

00:09:03.520 --> 00:09:06.950
You can’t catch me with that.

00:09:08.340 --> 00:09:09.750
Wait!

00:09:19.350 --> 00:09:20.670
That punk…

00:09:21.300 --> 00:09:23.410
Where did he go?

00:09:28.790 --> 00:09:32.000
I won’t run or hide.

00:09:32.000 --> 00:09:34.610
You!  Come down!

00:09:34.610 --> 00:09:38.160
If you go near that place, 
it would be troublesome.

00:09:39.270 --> 00:09:42.130
Just as I thought, you're a Dark Signer.

00:09:42.330 --> 00:09:46.130
It seems there’s a misunderstanding.

00:09:46.130 --> 00:09:53.250
Since you have that ugly Marker, I also 
thought that you were a Dark Signer.

00:09:56.110 --> 00:09:57.840
I see.

00:09:57.840 --> 00:10:01.620
You're friends with Yusei 
Fudo and Jack Atlas.

00:10:01.620 --> 00:10:02.630
What?

00:10:04.320 --> 00:10:09.050
It seems you’re not a 
Dark Signer.  Who are you?

00:10:10.060 --> 00:10:13.890
I forgot to introduce myself.

00:10:13.890 --> 00:10:20.410
I'm Yeager, the right-hand man of the Public 
Maintenance Department’s Director Godwin.

00:10:20.410 --> 00:10:22.710
Public Maintenance Department?

00:10:22.710 --> 00:10:27.500
Anyway, don't go near 
that hole.  That is all.

00:10:31.020 --> 00:10:33.310
You’re persistent.

00:10:33.310 --> 00:10:37.690
Why is someone from the Public Maintenance 
Department lurking around here?

00:10:37.690 --> 00:10:43.510
Didn’t your boss tell Yusei 
to defeat the Dark Signers?

00:10:43.510 --> 00:10:49.860
That information is secret.  I’m not 
required to answer a sewer rat like you.

00:10:50.060 --> 00:10:55.470
I'm no sewer rat!  A freaky clown 
like you can't talk to me like that!

00:10:55.470 --> 00:10:59.910
Sheesh, you just don't give up.

00:10:59.910 --> 00:11:03.340
Fine.  I’ll duel you.

00:11:04.290 --> 00:11:08.690
It'll be good to warm up before 
battling the Dark Signers!

00:11:10.280 --> 00:11:11.710
Duel!

00:11:12.250 --> 00:11:15.270
I go first!  I draw!

00:11:17.100 --> 00:11:21.720
I summon Blackwing – Bora 
the Spear in attack position!

00:11:25.440 --> 00:11:30.300
I see that it’s a deck 
that focuses on Blackwings.

00:11:30.500 --> 00:11:32.240
And one more!

00:11:32.240 --> 00:11:36.240
I also Special Summon Gale the 
Whirlwind in attack position!

00:11:38.810 --> 00:11:45.730
I can Special Summon it from my hand 
when there’s a Blackwing on my field.

00:11:46.350 --> 00:11:49.790
I set one card and end my turn.

00:11:49.790 --> 00:11:55.760
You have a monster and a Tuner Monster, 
but you’re not going to Synchro Summon?

00:11:56.750 --> 00:11:59.250
Now it’s your turn.

00:11:59.250 --> 00:12:03.230
I hope you don’t come 
to regret that decision.

00:12:20.520 --> 00:12:22.620
Jack, what's that for?

00:12:22.810 --> 00:12:26.120
I’m going to teach you what you have to do!

00:12:33.700 --> 00:12:35.210
What’s with the look in your eyes?

00:12:35.210 --> 00:12:40.340
You lost to Kiryu because you 
have eyes like an abandoned dog!

00:12:40.340 --> 00:12:47.680
I hate you because you took away 
my King status and humiliated me!

00:12:47.680 --> 00:12:51.010
Where's the Yusei Fudo from that time?

00:12:51.780 --> 00:12:56.000
Kiryu didn't die, Yusei!  You did!

00:12:56.950 --> 00:12:58.690
I can fight him!

00:12:58.690 --> 00:13:02.910
Even though Kiryu is a former friend, 
he’s now an enemy that must be defeated!

00:13:04.670 --> 00:13:06.310
I…

00:13:07.570 --> 00:13:11.820
If he hates you, then you have 
to hate him back even more!

00:13:11.820 --> 00:13:15.780
If you can’t do that, then 
you’re just an empty shell!

00:13:23.120 --> 00:13:26.550
I'm not dead!

00:13:28.000 --> 00:13:30.220
Those are the eyes I was looking for.

00:13:31.800 --> 00:13:32.930
Hey…

00:13:34.200 --> 00:13:37.750
Why don’t you want to go to Satellite?

00:13:39.230 --> 00:13:41.810
Because I always get carried away.

00:13:41.810 --> 00:13:49.580
So when people say that I’m a hero that 
protects his sister, I act like it's true.

00:13:49.580 --> 00:13:51.470
I'm so stupid.

00:13:51.980 --> 00:13:57.770
But I was reminded of the 
truth when Divine defeated me.

00:13:58.240 --> 00:14:01.020
I'm not a hero.

00:14:02.110 --> 00:14:03.500
Lua…

00:14:04.600 --> 00:14:14.000
I’ve never said this, but when I was 
little, I thought you were in my way, Luca.

00:14:14.000 --> 00:14:16.270
That you were a burden.

00:14:16.270 --> 00:14:21.970
I couldn't go to duel tournaments or the 
King's autograph sessions because of you.

00:14:22.980 --> 00:14:24.400
I knew that.

00:14:24.810 --> 00:14:27.670
I was always sick.

00:14:28.270 --> 00:14:31.890
That's why you were never 
allowed to go out and play.

00:14:32.110 --> 00:14:36.290
I always wanted to apologize.  
I’m really sorry.

00:14:36.290 --> 00:14:40.820
Stop that!  I’ll feel 
embarrassed if you apologize!

00:14:41.230 --> 00:14:44.700
Luca, you’re amazing!  You’re a Signer!

00:14:44.700 --> 00:14:47.310
You’re the reincarnation 
of an ancient warrior!

00:14:47.310 --> 00:14:49.200
You're nothing like me!

00:14:49.980 --> 00:14:52.910
The person who was the 
real burden was myself.

00:14:52.910 --> 00:14:56.660
If I come along, I’ll only get in your way.

00:14:57.600 --> 00:14:59.990
I’ll stay here and cheer you on.

00:14:59.990 --> 00:15:07.950
Hooray, hooray, Luca!  Beat the Dark Signers!

00:15:09.220 --> 00:15:10.910
You idiot.

00:15:11.610 --> 00:15:15.040
I’m scared!

00:15:15.040 --> 00:15:20.010
If you don't come along, then I don't 
know what's going to happen to me!

00:15:20.010 --> 00:15:21.080
Luca…

00:15:21.930 --> 00:15:24.070
It’s fine if you’re not a hero.

00:15:24.070 --> 00:15:28.880
Just protect me, like always.

00:15:34.360 --> 00:15:35.560
Jack.

00:15:35.900 --> 00:15:36.980
What is it?

00:15:37.450 --> 00:15:39.800
You made me come to my senses.

00:15:39.800 --> 00:15:44.240
The Dark Signers are putting 
this world in danger.

00:15:44.240 --> 00:15:50.730
In order to protect my Satellite friends 
and those I hold dear, I must be prepared.

00:15:51.640 --> 00:15:55.760
You never change.  You're always talking 
about your friends and those who needs protection.

00:16:04.110 --> 00:16:07.250
The person I need to protect is...

00:16:15.660 --> 00:16:17.800
It looks like you made up your mind.

00:16:17.800 --> 00:16:18.800
Aki.

00:16:18.800 --> 00:16:24.900
I’ll battle alongside you.  I feel 
that it'll lead me to what I need to do.

00:16:25.600 --> 00:16:26.860
I see.

00:16:29.510 --> 00:16:31.270
Yusei!

00:16:32.560 --> 00:16:33.750
Luca.

00:16:34.570 --> 00:16:36.240
Are you going?

00:16:36.240 --> 00:16:37.150
Yes.

00:16:45.810 --> 00:16:47.880
Yusei!

00:16:50.180 --> 00:16:52.260
I understand now!

00:16:52.260 --> 00:16:57.550
The reason why you’re cool is because 
you always believe in yourself and battle!

00:16:57.550 --> 00:16:58.660
Lua!

00:16:58.660 --> 00:17:02.580
Jack, you’re no longer the 
King, but you’re still cool!

00:17:02.580 --> 00:17:05.890
"No longer the King?"

00:17:05.890 --> 00:17:08.310
That's why I can also become cool!

00:17:08.310 --> 00:17:12.150
You can’t!  A kid like 
you can never be cool!

00:17:12.150 --> 00:17:14.810
I will!  I will definitely become cool!

00:17:15.010 --> 00:17:17.310
I declare that you will never be cool!

00:17:17.310 --> 00:17:20.050
If I say that I will, then I will.  I will!

00:17:20.560 --> 00:17:23.760
Here I go.  I draw!

00:17:26.250 --> 00:17:30.030
I set three cards and end my turn.

00:17:30.030 --> 00:17:33.240
What?  You're just going to set cards?

00:17:33.240 --> 00:17:35.270
You don't have any monsters in your hand?

00:17:35.470 --> 00:17:36.950
Maybe...

00:17:38.620 --> 00:17:41.260
Now it’s your turn.

00:17:41.260 --> 00:17:45.040
Then here I come!  I draw!

00:17:45.240 --> 00:17:51.180
I want to get the advantage right away, 
but those three set cards are a problem.

00:17:53.450 --> 00:17:56.190
All I can do for now is a quick attack!

00:17:56.190 --> 00:17:59.640
Bora the Spear attacks you directly!

00:18:00.860 --> 00:18:04.020
I activate my trap Imperial Manners.

00:18:04.020 --> 00:18:07.860
I can activate this card when 
your monster declares an attack.

00:18:07.860 --> 00:18:14.150
If I have no monsters on my field, then all 
your monsters in attack position are destroyed!

00:18:14.150 --> 00:18:15.410
What?

00:18:17.770 --> 00:18:19.570
You must be kidding!

00:18:19.570 --> 00:18:22.370
I activate my trap Urgent Tuning!

00:18:22.370 --> 00:18:26.400
If I use this to Synchro Summon, 
they won't be destroyed.

00:18:26.400 --> 00:18:29.890
It’s a waste to use my trump card 
now, but it can’t be helped.

00:18:30.520 --> 00:18:34.800
That’s a card that lets you Synchro 
Summon during the Battle Phase.

00:18:34.800 --> 00:18:37.850
But too bad.

00:18:38.110 --> 00:18:43.310
The Continuous Trap Discord.  
When this card is on the field,

00:18:43.310 --> 00:18:45.910
neither of us can Synchro Summon.

00:18:45.910 --> 00:18:47.390
What?

00:18:47.390 --> 00:18:51.640
You take Imperial Manners's effect.

00:18:55.550 --> 00:18:59.040
You destroyed my monsters and 
prevent me from Synchro Summoning?

00:18:59.040 --> 00:19:05.520
When you didn’t Synchro Summon on your 
previous turn, I was able to figure out your strategy.

00:19:06.270 --> 00:19:10.430
Don't get cocky because your 
little combo succeeded!

00:19:10.430 --> 00:19:13.460
I set one card and end my turn!

00:19:13.460 --> 00:19:21.220
Sheesh, why did a fool like you 
set foot in this dangerous area?

00:19:21.220 --> 00:19:27.180
So that I can defeat the Dark Signers 
with a special combo, of course!

00:19:27.360 --> 00:19:32.150
Just quit.  A swamp rat 
like you can't defeat them.

00:19:32.150 --> 00:19:33.370
Leave me alone!

00:19:33.370 --> 00:19:35.700
Even if I’m a fool or a swamp rat,

00:19:35.700 --> 00:19:39.700
the duelist with the stronger battle 
spirit always wins in the end!

00:19:40.870 --> 00:19:47.790
What a cute fool you are.  I'll 
give you something to remember.

00:19:47.790 --> 00:19:55.110
Here I go.  I draw!  I summon 
Jester Lord in attack position.

00:19:59.990 --> 00:20:01.550
What’s that?

00:20:02.360 --> 00:20:05.020
Attack him directly!

00:20:07.050 --> 00:20:11.650
It attack me directly when it has zero 
attack points?  What are you thinking?

00:20:13.100 --> 00:20:17.850
When there are no other 
monsters on the field,

00:20:17.850 --> 00:20:23.850
Jester Lord gains 1000 attack points 
for every spell and trap card.

00:20:23.850 --> 00:20:24.590
What?

00:20:24.590 --> 00:20:28.590
There are currently three spell 
and trap cards on the field.

00:20:28.590 --> 00:20:31.790
Therefore, Jester Lord’s 
attack points are…

00:20:34.500 --> 00:20:39.530
3000 attack points?  You must be joking!

00:20:39.530 --> 00:20:45.800
I activate my trap Dust Tornado!  
I use this to destroy Discord!

00:20:46.050 --> 00:20:51.390
By getting rid of two trap cards, Jester 
Lord’s attack points decrease to 1000 points.

00:20:51.560 --> 00:20:56.870
I’ll still take damage, but I'll be 
able to Synchro Summon on my next turn.

00:20:56.870 --> 00:21:00.870
I activate the Continuous 
Trap Imperial Custom.

00:21:00.870 --> 00:21:06.110
All Continuous Traps on my field other 
than this one cannot be destroyed.

00:21:06.320 --> 00:21:09.810
Therefore, Jester Lord 
has 2000 attack points!

00:21:09.810 --> 00:21:10.810
What?

00:21:11.420 --> 00:21:14.220
Jester Lord attacks you directly.

00:21:20.100 --> 00:21:22.210
Well done.

00:21:22.210 --> 00:21:27.210
I didn’t know the Public Maintenance 
Department had someone who did crazy duels.

00:21:27.210 --> 00:21:30.360
Thanks for the flattery.

00:21:30.360 --> 00:21:36.910
You also did well in lowering Jester 
Lord’s attack points by activating a trap.

00:21:37.510 --> 00:21:40.680
Then let's keep having fun!

00:21:56.540 --> 00:22:01.010
We look up and vow towards the shining light

00:22:01.370 --> 00:22:06.080
We will build our own future

00:22:06.550 --> 00:22:11.520
The far dawn shines blindingly

00:22:11.980 --> 00:22:16.690
Awaken in the wonderland

00:22:22.290 --> 00:22:31.830
The overflowing wave of emotions approaches

00:22:32.260 --> 00:22:37.400
This world can’t be solved using algorithms

00:22:37.470 --> 00:22:42.110
Even if it loses its light

00:22:42.580 --> 00:22:47.380
The hourglass behind the 
heart can’t be turned

00:22:47.380 --> 00:22:51.850
Roll the dice and get 
out and follow the light

00:22:52.050 --> 00:22:57.430
Fly towards tomorrow faster than a heartbeat

00:22:57.560 --> 00:23:02.310
This journey has no end

00:23:02.530 --> 00:23:07.770
There’s no meaning 
because there are no tears

00:23:08.200 --> 00:23:13.010
Hear my voice
